  "name": "Harnessed Life keeps a Tormented Soul on a quarter of hits taken (#2659)",
  "contract": [
    "Harnessed Life 705406 (live): 'Your Tormented Souls now has a 25% chance to not consume a stack from damage",
    "taken.' Its effect is a -25 SPELLMOD_CHANCE_OF_SUCCESS on 500481-500483, which the core applies to 500481's proc",
    "chance, so a hit that keeps its stack also does not heal. Tormented Souls is recast every 4 sec (6 stacks with",
    "Soulfused Constitution) so it never runs out. Heals per landed hit near 0.75 is consistent; 1.0, every hit",
    "consuming, is rejected (false failure about 1e-4 at 30 or more hits)."
  ],
